Martinize molecule and simplify topology.

The default mapping backend is CGParam. Martini Mapper can be selected while
keeping AshGC charge assignment and overlay generation in simplemartini:

    run_simplemartini(
        "ligand",
        mol,
        mapping_backend="martini_mapper",
        path_mapping="mapping",
        path_out="output",
    )

Set ``martini_mapper_run_xtb=False`` to use Martini Mapper without its xTB
parameterisation pipeline. The final overlay is written to
``output/ligand_overlay.svg``.
